  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Commitment Program Eligibility > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L007: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST be of type String.\"",
    "  L010: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST conform to [StringHandling](#attributes.stringhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L011: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST conform to [JsonObjectFormat](#attributes.jsonobjectformat) requirements.\"",
    "  L012: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST NOT be null when a charge is eligible for a [*commitment program*](#glossary:commitment-program), regardless of whether a [*commitment*](#glossary:commitment) was actually applied to the charge.\"",
    "  L013: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST NOT consider transient account configurations or quotas that might temporarily prevent purchase or participation in a *commitment program*.\"",
    "  L014: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST include all publicly available *commitment programs* for which the usage is eligible.\"",
    "  L015: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility SHOULD include negotiated *commitment programs* for which the usage is eligible.\"",
    "  L016: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST NOT include data related to *commitment* [*periods*](#glossary:period) or payment options.\"",
    "  L017: \"CommitmentProgramEligibility MUST conform to [CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject](#datasets.costandusage.commitmentprogrameligibility.commitmentprogrameligibilityobject) requirements when CommitmentProgramEligibility is not null.\"",
    "L025: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L027: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject MUST have a top-level property key \\\"CommitmentPrograms\\\".\"",
    "  L028: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject MAY contain additional data generator-defined top-level property keys.\"",
    "  L029: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject MUST have property keys that begin with the string \\\"x_\\\" unless it is a FOCUS-defined property key.\"",
    "  L030: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L031: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST be of type Array.\"",
    "    L032: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST contain one or more objects.\"",
    "    L033: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST be of type JSON Object.\"",
    "    L034: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST have a property key \\\"ProgramType\\\".\"",
    "    L035: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MAY contain additional data generator-defined property keys.\"",
    "    L036: \"Each entry in CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms MUST have property keys that begin with the string \\\"x_\\\" unless it is a FOCUS-defined property key.\"",
    "    L037: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST be of type String.\"",
    "    L038: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST NOT be null.\"",
    "    L039: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST correspond to a *commitment program* type supported by the service provider (e.g., \\\"FlexibleSpendPlan\\\", \\\"ResourceReservation\\\", \\\"BulkCapacityCredit\\\", \\\"AdvanceResourceCommitment\\\").\"",
    "    L040: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType MUST equal [CommitmentDiscountType](#datasets.costandusage.commitmentdiscounttype) for one object in CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms when CommitmentDiscountType is not null.\"",
    "    L041: \"CommitmentProgramEligibilityObject.CommitmentPrograms.ProgramType SHOULD correspond to terminology disclosed by the service provider in public documentation.\""
  ],
